        <li><span class="hist">◆</span> <strong>Ronald Hutton</strong>, <em>The Triumph of the Moon</em> (1999) — the honest history of the modern revival.</li>
        <li><span class="myth">◆</span> <strong>The Mabinogion</strong> and <strong>the Táin</strong> — read as literature of genius written by Christians about a remembered pagan world, which is what they are.</li>
